<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"<i>Solanum lycopersicum</i> 自交系基因組(Genomes of <i>Solanum lycopersicum</i> inbred lines)" &>

<div class="page_introduction">
  番茄自交系的基因組主要由 <a href="/organism/1/view/"><i>Solanum lycopersicum</i></a> 組成，並帶有來自各種野生番茄物種的基因組片段。育種者培育自交系是為了在保持馴化種遺傳背景的同時，引入來自多個野生種和/或種質的有價值的遺傳變異。這是透過雜交，隨後進行多代回交和選擇來實現的。(The genomes of tomato inbred lines consist mostly of <a href="/organism/1/view/"><i>Solanum lycopersicum</i></a>
  and carry genome fragments originating from various tomato wild species.
  Breeders develop inbreds for introducing valuable genetic variation from multiple wild species and/or accessions while maintaining
  a genetic background of the domesticated species. This is achieved by outcrossing followed by multiple genetrations of backcrossing and selection.)

</div>


<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => 'Gh13 基因組(Gh13 genome)' &>
  Gh13 是一條攜帶 <a href="/locus/8216/view"><i>Ty3</i></a> 基因的粉蝨傳播雙生病毒 (begomovirus) 抗性品系。該品系在瓜地馬拉開發 <a href="/publication/18734/view">(Mejia et al., 2004)</a>，在該地經過多個季節的測試，始終表現出針對當地高病毒壓力的極佳抗性。據報導，Gh13 的抗性來源於 <a href="/organism/938/view"><i>S. habrochaites</i></a> <a href="/publication/18735/view">(Vidavsky and Czosnek, 1998)</a>。(Gh13 is a begomovirus resistant line carrying the <a href="/locus/8216/view"><i>Ty3</i></a> gene.
  This line was developed in Guatamala <a href="/publication/18734/view">(Mejia et al., 2004)</a>
  were it has been tested over multiple seasons and consistently shows very good resistance against high begomovirus pressure there. Resistance in Gh13 is reportedly derived from <a href="/organism/938/view"><i>S. habrochaites</i></a>  <a href="/publication/18735/view">(Vidavsky and Czosnek, 1998)</a>)<br />

