<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => 'BTI87 基因組(BTI87 genome)' &>
  BTI87 是一條攜帶 <a href="/locus/8216/view"><i>Ty3</i></a> 基因的粉蝨傳播雙生病毒抗性品系。BTI87 在瓜地馬拉開發，並維持源自抗粉蝨雙生病毒自交系 Gc171 的高水準抗性，而後者又源自 <a href="/organism/1373/view"><i>S. chilense</i></a> 種質 <a href="/stock/28625/view">LA1932</a> <a href="/publication/18736/view">(Scott and Schuster, 2007)</a>。(BTI87 is a begomovirus resistant line carrying the <a href="/locus/8216/view"><i>Ty3</i></a> gene.
  BTI87 was developed in Guatemala and maintains a high level of resistance derived from the begomovirus-resistant inbred Gc171, which is in turn derived from <a href="/organism/1373/view"><i>S. chilense</i></a> accession <a href="/stock/28625/view">LA1932</a> <a href="/publication/18736/view">(Scott and Schuster, 2007)</a>)<br />

