<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => 'Fla630 基因組(Fla630 genome)' &>
  Fla630 是一條攜帶 <a href="/locus/718/view"><i>I-3</i></a> 基因的抗鐮刀菌枯萎病第 3 生理小種 (Fusarium Wilt Race 3) 番茄自交系。I-3 基因從 <a href="/organism/19/view"><i>S. pennellii</i></a> 滲入，賦予對第 3 生理小種的抗性。儘管 I-3 提供了有效的防控，但它與幾種園藝性狀呈負相關，包括對細菌性斑點病 (Xanthomonas spp.) 的敏感性增加。(Fla630 is a  Fusarium Wilt Race 3 resistant tomato inbred line carrying the <a href="/locus/718/view"><i>I-3</i></a> gene.
   The I-3 gene was introgressed from <a href="/organism/19/view"><i>S. pennellii</i></a> and confers resistance to race 3. Although I-3 provides effective control, it is negatively associated with several horticultural traits, including increased sensitivity to bacterial spot disease (Xanthomonas spp.))<br />

